#: ../../source/algorithms/primal_dual.rst:4
msgid "Primal-Dual Algorithms in Federated Learning"
msgstr "联邦学习中的原始对偶算法"

#: ../../source/algorithms/primal_dual.rst:6
msgid "In traditional optimization, primal-dual algorithms are a classic tool for problems with an explicit primal-dual structure. Consider the consensus optimization problem with an explicit global-variable constraint (note the subtle difference from the consensus set formulation in the :ref:`operator splitting <fl_alg_operator_splitting>` and :ref:`skipping <fl_alg_skipping>` sections),"
msgstr "在传统的最优化方法中，原始-对偶算法 (Primal-Dual Algorithms) 也是一类求解具有显式原始-对偶结构问题的常用算法。考虑带显式全局变量约束的共识优化问题（注意它与 :ref:`算子分裂 <fl_alg_operator_splitting>` 与 :ref:`跳步 <fl_alg_skipping>` 两节中共识集格式的细微差别），"

#: ../../source/algorithms/primal_dual.rst:12
msgid ""
"\\DeclareMathOperator*{\\minimize}{minimize}\n"
"\\DeclareMathOperator*{\\maximize}{maximize}\n"
"\\DeclareMathOperator*{\\argmin}{arg\\,min}\n"
"\\newcommand{\\col}{\\operatorname{col}}\n"
"\\newcommand{\\R}{\\mathbb{R}}\n"
"\n"
"\\begin{array}{cl}\n"
"\\minimize & F(\\Theta) := \\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K f_k(\\theta_k), \\\\\n"
"\\text{subject to} & \\theta_k = \\theta, ~ k = 1, \\ldots, K,\n"
"\\end{array}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/primal_dual.rst:26
msgid "with :math:`\\Theta = \\col(\\theta_1, \\cdots, \\theta_K)` and :math:`\\theta, \\theta_1, \\ldots, \\theta_K \\in \\R^d`. The *augmented Lagrangian* (AL) of :eq:`fedpd-constraint` is"
msgstr "其中 :math:`\\Theta = \\col(\\theta_1, \\cdots, \\theta_K)`，:math:`\\theta, \\theta_1, \\ldots, \\theta_K \\in \\R^d`。约束优化问题 :eq:`fedpd-constraint` 的*增广拉格朗日函数* (Augmented Lagrangian, AL) 为"

#: ../../source/algorithms/primal_dual.rst:30
msgid ""
"\\mathcal{L}(\\theta, \\Theta, \\Lambda) = \\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K \\mathcal{L}_k(\\theta, \\theta_k, \\lambda_k),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathcal{L}_k(\\theta, \\theta_k, \\lambda_k) = f_k(\\theta_k) + \\langle \\lambda_k, \\theta_k - \\theta \\rangle + \\frac{1}{2s} \\lVert \\theta_k - \\theta \\rVert^2,"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/primal_dual.rst:37
msgid "where :math:`\\Lambda = \\col(\\lambda_1, \\ldots, \\lambda_K)` collects the *dual variables* (the Lagrangian multipliers) and :math:`s > 0` is the penalty parameter. Applying a gradient ascent-type method to the dual problem :math:`\\maximize_\\Lambda \\ G(\\Lambda) := \\inf_{\\theta, \\Theta} \\mathcal{L}(\\theta, \\Theta, \\Lambda)` yields the generic iteration scheme for this class of problems,"
msgstr "其中 :math:`\\Lambda = \\col(\\lambda_1, \\ldots, \\lambda_K)` 是*对偶变量* (Dual Variable)，亦称拉格朗日乘子 (Lagrangian Multiplier)，:math:`s > 0` 是罚参数。将梯度提升类的算法应用于对偶问题 :math:`\\maximize_\\Lambda \\ G(\\Lambda) := \\inf_{\\theta, \\Theta} \\mathcal{L}(\\theta, \\Theta, \\Lambda)`，即得到求解这类问题的一般迭代格式"

#: ../../source/algorithms/primal_dual.rst:43
msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\theta_k^{(t+1)} & = \\argmin_{\\theta_k} \\mathcal{L}_k\\left( \\theta^{(t)}, \\theta_k, \\lambda_k^{(t)} \\right), \\\\\n"
"\\lambda_k^{(t+1)} & = \\lambda_k^{(t)} + \\frac{1}{s} \\left( \\theta_k^{(t+1)} - \\theta^{(t)} \\right), \\\\\n"
"\\theta^{(t+1)} & = \\argmin_{\\theta} \\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K \\left\\{ \\frac{1}{2s} \\lVert \\theta_k^{(t+1)} - \\theta \\rVert^2 - \\langle \\lambda_k^{(t+1)}, \\theta \\rangle \\right\\}\n"
"= \\frac{1}{K} \\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K \\left( \\theta_k^{(t+1)} + s\\lambda_k^{(t+1)} \\right).\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/primal_dual.rst:56
msgid "``FedPD``: Federated Primal-Dual Algorithm"
msgstr "``FedPD``：联邦原始对偶算法"

#: ../../source/algorithms/primal_dual.rst:58
msgid "Based on this scheme, the ``FedPD`` algorithm [:footcite:ct:`zhang2020fedpd`] alternates the client-side local updates, the client-side dual updates, and the server-side global averaging. Two design choices are worth highlighting."
msgstr "基于这一迭代格式，文献 [:footcite:ct:`zhang2020fedpd`] 设计了联邦原始对偶算法 ``FedPD``，其交替执行子节点侧的本地更新、子节点侧的对偶更新以及中心节点侧的全局平均。有两点设计值得特别注意。"

#: ../../source/algorithms/primal_dual.rst:62
msgid "**A flexible local solver.** For the local update in :eq:`al-iter` (the minimization of the local AL :math:`\\mathcal{L}_k`), ``FedPD`` allows an arbitrary client-side solver :math:`\\operatorname{\\mathbf{Oracle}}_k` -- plain SGD, or combined with variance-reduction techniques as in ``SCAFFOLD``. This flexibility is a hallmark of federated optimization (the same idea as the server-side ``FedOpt``). In the variance-reduced case, one can further *linearize* :math:`f_k` at the current inner iterate :math:`\\theta_k^{(t, r)}` (with local gradient :math:`g_k^{(t, r)}`), under which the local AL becomes a quadratic whose minimizer has a closed form,"
msgstr "**灵活的局部求解器。**对于 :eq:`al-iter` 中的本地更新（即局部增广拉格朗日函数 :math:`\\mathcal{L}_k` 的极小化），``FedPD`` 允许子节点使用任意的求解器 :math:`\\operatorname{\\mathbf{Oracle}}_k`——可以是普通的随机梯度下降，也可以如 ``SCAFFOLD`` 那样结合方差缩减技术。这种灵活性是联邦优化的显著特点（与中心节点侧的 ``FedOpt`` 是同一思想）。在使用方差缩减时，还可以进一步将 :math:`f_k` 在当前内循环迭代点 :math:`\\theta_k^{(t, r)}` 处*线性化*（记局部梯度为 :math:`g_k^{(t, r)}`），此时局部增广拉格朗日函数成为二次函数，其极小点具有解析形式，"

#: ../../source/algorithms/primal_dual.rst:71
msgid ""
"\\argmin \\ \\widetilde{\\mathcal{L}}(\\theta_{k})\n"
"= \\frac{s}{s+\\gamma} \\, \\theta_k^{(t,r)} + \\frac{\\gamma}{s+\\gamma} \\, \\theta_{k, 0}^{(t)} - \\frac{s\\gamma}{s+\\gamma}\\left( g_k^{(t,r)} + \\lambda_k^{(t)} \\right),"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/primal_dual.rst:77
msgid "where :math:`\\gamma` is the linearization (proximal) coefficient and :math:`\\theta_{k, 0}^{(t)}` is the value of the local model at the beginning of the round."
msgstr "其中 :math:`\\gamma` 是线性化（临近）系数，:math:`\\theta_{k, 0}^{(t)}` 是本轮开始时局部模型的取值。"

#: ../../source/algorithms/primal_dual.rst:80
msgid "**Skipping the global step.** The outer (server) step in :eq:`al-iter` is executed only with probability :math:`1 - p`. When it is skipped, the clients use their own :math:`\\widetilde{\\theta}^{(t)} = \\theta_k^{(t-1)} + s \\lambda_k^{(t-1)}` in place of the global model,"
msgstr "**跳过全局步。**:eq:`al-iter` 中的外层（中心节点）步仅以概率 :math:`1 - p` 执行。当它被跳过时，子节点用自身的 :math:`\\widetilde{\\theta}^{(t)} = \\theta_k^{(t-1)} + s \\lambda_k^{(t-1)}` 代替全局模型，"

#: ../../source/algorithms/primal_dual.rst:85
msgid ""
"\\theta^{(t+1)} = \\begin{cases}\n"
"\\frac{1}{K} \\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K \\left( \\theta_k^{(t+1)} + s\\lambda_k^{(t+1)} \\right), & \\text{with probability } 1 - p, \\\\\n"
"\\theta^{(t)}, & \\text{with probability } p,\n"
"\\end{cases}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/primal_dual.rst:93
msgid "so the expensive server round -- exactly the communication bottleneck -- is skipped with probability :math:`p`. Moreover, the skipping probability can be made *heterogeneity-aware*: [:footcite:ct:`zhang2020fedpd`] (TABLE III) relates the achievable :math:`p` to the degree of data heterogeneity across clients :math:`G` (quantified via the bounded gradient dissimilarity), the target accuracy :math:`\\varepsilon` of the (epsilon-)stationary point, and the Lipschitz constant :math:`L` of :math:`f, f_k`, with the step size :math:`s = \\frac{\\sqrt{5}-1}{8L}`:"
msgstr "于是代价高昂的中心节点轮次——恰恰是通信瓶颈——以概率 :math:`p` 被跳过。更进一步，跳步概率还可以做成*异质感知*的：[:footcite:ct:`zhang2020fedpd`]（TABLE III）给出了可达的 :math:`p` 与子节点间数据分布异质程度 :math:`G`（通过梯度差异有界性刻画）、(ε-)稳定点的目标精度 :math:`\\varepsilon` 以及 :math:`f, f_k` 的 Lipschitz 常数 :math:`L` 之间的关系，其中步长取 :math:`s = \\frac{\\sqrt{5}-1}{8L}`："

#: ../../source/algorithms/primal_dual.rst:100
msgid ""
"p \\approx \\begin{cases}\n"
"\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{36s} \\cdot \\frac{\\varepsilon}{G^2}}, & \\text{if } 0 \\leqslant p < \\frac{1-2Ls}{1+Ls}, \\\\\n"
"1 - 2 \\Big/ \\log\\left(\\frac{1}{42s} \\cdot \\frac{\\varepsilon}{G^2}\\right), & \\text{if } \\frac{1-2Ls}{1+Ls} < p < 1.\n"
"\\end{cases}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/primal_dual.rst:108
msgid "The more homogeneous the client data (smaller :math:`G`), the more aggressively the communication rounds can be skipped. The pseudocode is summarized below."
msgstr "子节点间的数据分布越均匀（:math:`G` 越小），通信轮就可以越激进地被跳过。伪代码总结如下。"

